OL,3,A'It's very overcrowded': Freed
OL,4,Aprisoners speak to BBC as new early
OL,5,Arelease scheme begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of prisoners across England
OL,8,Fand Wales are being released early
OL,9,Ftoday under a new scheme designed to
OL,10,Ffree up prison space
OL,12,FOffenders serving sentences of up to 19
OL,13,Fmonths are now eligible for release
OL,14,Fafter a third of their term - here's a
OL,15,Fquick look at how the scheme will work
OL,17,FFreed prisoner David doesn't think the
OL,18,Fnew scheme will work because of a lack
OL,19,Fof support on the outside. Another man
OL,20,Fsays HMP Wandsworth is so crowded "even
OL,21,Fthe rats are complaining"
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
