OL,3,A'It's very overcrowded': Freed
OL,4,Aprisoners speak to BBC as new early
OL,5,Arelease scheme begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolicing leaders are also expecting the
OL,8,Fscheme to create additional demands in
OL,9,Fterms of licence breaches, recalls and
OL,10,Ffurther offending
OL,12,FA prison governor says the scheme is
OL,13,F"much needed relief" from the pressure
OL,14,Fof overcrowding, but cautions it won't
OL,15,F"solve the overarching problem"
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
