OL,3,AVape tax comes into effect - but prices
OL,4,Awon't rise yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price of vapes is set to rise as a
OL,7,Fnew tax comes into effect, with the aim
OL,8,Fof making vaping less attractive to
OL,9,Fchildren and young people.
OL,11,FThe Vaping Product Duty will be imposed
OL,12,Fat a rate of #2.20 per 10ml of
OL,13,Fe-liquid. However, many customers will
OL,14,Fnot see a jump in prices immediately,
OL,15,Fas sellers have six months to sell old
OL,16,Fstock at the pre-duty price.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
