OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVape tax comes into effect - but prices
OL,4,Awon't rise yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government wants to reduce the
OL,7,Fappeal of vapes by making them more
OL,8,Fexpensive, as more evidence of its
OL,9,Fadverse effect on health comes out,
OL,10,Fparticularly on children and young
OL,11,Fpeople.
OL,13,FThe vaping industry has lobbied against
OL,14,Fthe new tax, saying that affordable
OL,15,Fvapes help people to quit smoking.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
